    <briefdescription>
<para>Add an arbitrary attribute and value to the diagnostic axis. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Any number of attributes can be added to a given axis. All attribute addition must be done before first <computeroutput>send_data</computeroutput> call.<linebreak/>
</para><para>If a real or integer attribute is already defined, a FATAL error will be called. If a character attribute is already defined, then it will be prepended to the existing attribute value. <linebreak/>
Example usage: <programlisting filename=".F90"><codeline><highlight class="keyword">call<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">diag_axis_add_attribute(diag_axis_id,<sp/>att_name,<sp/>att_value)<sp/></highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>    </detaileddescription>
